# Normalize line endings: text files stored as LF in git, checked out as-is.
# Without this, the Windows/WSL checkout shows every file modified (CRLF churn)
# and replica diffs (an/ bach/ tu/ vs original/) become 100% noise.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tiff binary
*.pt binary
*.npy binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.ipynb text eol=lf
